  "note": "Every library Md.Comp.* key that can be checked against a Material Web token, and which one. The pairing is by meaning, not by name: Material Web ships one file per variant (fab-primary-small) where this library ships one token per size (Fab.Small.*), and its names are more specific (container-height vs Size). A library key with no entry here is unverified, and the test says so rather than inventing a comparison. The entries whose names differ across the two vocabularies are the interesting ones: that is where a transcription error would hide.",
  "excluded_by_design": {
   "Md.Comp.NavigationBar.Flexible.Container.Height": "Material Web's baseline navigation bar is 80px and v0_192 has no flexible/horizontal variant; 64 is a rail-era value this library's own docs promise. Copying 80 would be wrong, not a fix.",
